{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1480,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3af7155a1a199e52eb3807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝、蓝、蓝靛果~♪\n……这是很好的发声练习哦。\n要一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b8cd0d699bbce7075491413b1249783cf28b3a6d7bfdf527d5bd51eb9d7f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:982023cf869b8f3df60d88ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天中午要做烧烤。\n黄油烤北寄贝，\n我会好好宣传一番的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d37f7b447aa5f78f54d3e0366ad9bb8c790c63b1ae87b3583c851252524d12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e850ae0097e935944449c467",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创升会给我发『地区振兴参考案例』\n这类的邮件！……但都是在深夜发\n她都是几点睡觉呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d49c4da02eeed66ee404772778650f8f01df20a25ee83287c7159b8f7a5b49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdad885c614708039e9284c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏花的话，交给我这个\n地方偶像吧！热闹又开心的歌曲\n还有交谈也会像花一样盛开哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9c8a58d492833e71ee72727791bb749a602e2de09101baffbe74cb740a5d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f635da2e01464a9a8fdc6205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊……但我不会偷懒的哦。\n我想，正是这种时候才能拉开差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4656624508b1b9e07c11a1e8a0e0799f9aa574e18da482589ace74b540cf08a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee8d95adc31608bda9e50b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋鲑鱼的季节到了呢。我可是把它\n当成榜样的！哪怕洄游一圈两圈\n也要让自己成长起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16cd535e0dd35146d31649dda5d6fa84b4e683fc4b7e44698e09834d97f8fb3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:624db523173922ab1936b605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，就算是我也觉得好冷……\n这身穿着的话，\n就这么跳进温泉也可以吧……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5e1e446fbe08e176a8dde2bf68f944063ed45fc5aa2fbe9ca997eaba2801bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d4ba7367d3451b02a8cb3d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休息要试试带着度假的心情\n悠闲度过吗？训练员也偶尔\n让自己的翅膀休息一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d617ab00234075edef723987362c1160c42c7198e7093051e64caa137d99113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7fe7e570950af1340fad9ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在玉米地里微笑，\n戴着草帽的地方偶像……\n好，下一个PV就这么定了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9091262ea758f3a91e12f7c54c29569c4de1b35e0921073bdbb7a6a3dfb6379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ca6028f57ee4233def5a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望我的表现，\r\n能为苫小牧的大家带来勇气……\r\n今天也请多指教了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "546d60cc5079675dc4f823882675e5adec52bba1c6fead0ac06db87954eeee21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad89dd62c4bfc1bec2371b63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06609e7cdf077c75eac5c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我绽放光芒，\r\n大家就会注意到苫小牧的光辉……\r\n我会怀着这样的信念努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce7d512063ee0dec0000089e2b7e042104bede5157bba5496a20288bb958f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517d16a94991d48476948d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我花了三十分钟以上的时间做\r\n伸展运动，心跳也已经变快了！\r\n随时都可以开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755cba8dedbdcb66308576ffaf15bbc250691bfc4efc9ab34ce64f2660750929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26e9d1ef3fe1f8c50b8899b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须锻炼出坚强的实力……！\r\n没错，就像凝聚了丰富鲜味的\r\n当季北寄贝一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f33af6fbaa816f5b8e36e9125e81afc099357c626e3bc311fc4c8a723dcc12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fa58d0aa727e5cf2171bff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了故乡，我希望尽我所能，\r\n把能做的事情全都做完……\r\n请你助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ad01f27200e0337de4d950c7d9f74c23f04eb9466a4f5a10888e72a5cb7106",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bf8a55a425f9cf964e37b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能遇见如此为我和苫小牧\r\n着想的人……真的是太好了。\r\n我由衷地这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49f10877d3ead3a5d3d3e8d2d7f361600744ae2900a7a8e8e337861c46e0baea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e4a44d4a551b1f6cc7124c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同心协力发扬苫小牧──\r\n如果有天能实现这个愿望……那个、\r\n你愿意跟我一起参加故乡的活动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1c9511f95a9a9a1da56f3036260798073e6a75a0a3783b2605fed685b8322b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e99a4ba3232d68c39851c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里让我想起了故乡的海岸呢……\r\n我越来越有干劲了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab2bf7b138b86fc0590d6446c7b154ed2433ed67a17afc9f06588be4d57a426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0250f7b46aacaef57aadd732",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变成鲑鱼！\n被风浪无情拍打，然后彻底变强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a64a7faa1bc8c9ac072e25d269cefceeb24c8b5477571fd55905b4058c0622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de8f4c18356c1e6ed71506c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还得更快才行。\n一旦在比赛中受到瞩目，\n苫小牧也能得到热切关注！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3762d9e0997acf4385d634d867c203995e96c7a57f0ec8e04e8d53411a306874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74cb4c3ac363f55d4cef9fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好~嘞，今天也要用北寄力量\n好好加油呗~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6244249a6947478837c7cc849ed623525133d8c9dfcf79ede47b89c250c838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edeb20338d43f75b134de2bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次度假，\n一定会带来好消息的……\n等着我，大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "884e40e39dd72de5770a416f6e478b2efc8f24e7dcd755f3934d0ffd7422a3ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f91402c4f1985ac68717b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉肩膀有些放松下来了。\n……不是独自一人的话\n心里就踏实多了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70168d7b576eae6558ed7e19749845f3a2be599deacfe86b59bf4763ec5ebd42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd5eb2c924d6ba7bab85b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心胸宽广，温暖地迎接了我……\n训练员就像港湾一样呢。\n是我在特雷森学园的苫小牧港♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e315ebd8d65a5eb3aa95e3662cd3e7ef59c181fdb1050ab744f6c77234cfab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4f7addceafd9bc43741e66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着训练员和故乡的人们……\n带着大家的愿望奔跑。\n实现了的话…要用笑容迎接我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9bb064eda54d7c7a5752bdd338e7958b8b28e6b099cd2f64facbce225dd539",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d142d7829d854f963f921b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成功发扬重要的故乡了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41c5d0209687e0fe4601a388f1c2d434f09ff743c462383f4ca850f31bb0d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9722e6dbfab95937cf296fcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能努力到这个地步……\r\n全都是多亏了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc57c3de5812815f01a17092550f96b92f559a48c3c93e52da53eab94bdd25da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b4103569938437694efbb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝贺会要在苫小牧的沙滩上举行，\n约好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe9df52127f03237b410c92ba6cdf0505f74129e674115c01510b4ee0b8c1e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e02c9d674c7232a9794fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛跑还有地方偶像……\n都留下了热烈的回忆♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7681119c0913e141be04a7f959e328bac1367767279ea9b79b53ba80e55d3569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147fbd6a831c4ac28a5a02ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会再继续努力下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86a65c46c8a0aebfc7b170efd88773c7024da2ed35b7f3daaa948430310201b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56ba89af5964ceed06252a88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身为地方偶像能做到的表现\r\n似乎会变得更丰富呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15e7e187657b12d83801222ccac3594bd75bcc375f6f2b6924d242ae12cd0aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7850196b44142f4d6e7551e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北港火山，将会全力以赴呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bfc9f028db50d75e97edcd9ff0ccad403bcaabbe5c785ab6cd5be7716e12652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334411af96539c8d76526885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最快的地方偶像，从苫小牧降临\r\n此地了呗～☆……很好，就是这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c41cdf3a5523a26378b864f40692de06eeaebe081e2c1cc9c134767604ddb4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6367cd9804124b9f26809896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相帮助很重要，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee12e0dc47b9179d629d92faa0d1061b6ef93e8b2282c2421ae99a313bfd9a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e4aaf4dec4790bd48066f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能帮上别人的忙……真的很棒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc2fe7b83b94151f2d376dc7783d5b0c6d030622ace9b2ed0baa8f4eeeb1ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64fb0338239c9725fe51d0c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！\n这样就能度过一个美好的夏天了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ebe14e435c08cd2c0c898d87d9c6ba7c0b59c5abd09f02b0e16c31827d0238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b16a218baea908c8bb0e4ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的热切视线，\n就让我一个人独占吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd2e8404a70843268ca587848eef0040926b653103c58b8b18dea9095af3457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde82de7b896794afb660325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是夏天！是度假！\r\n是苫小牧啊~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b1eadea6fac8754de22f280821dc38b45328564dd82f9f5afdb1abf1dde746c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3189db836fd4fe3655ca8c3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北港火山哒呗！\n前往海滩，准备开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04360d119a6349ef9ee372104554c3b13b1c2e2f1730767723a6d95b701a71c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8539f7663f62900a65cfaab0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eaa6d4664a6a948d48352e7d645b17447ba029312ed3cf534ee9622c4a51e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b220835b73072a8856ef8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你真的是个很了不起的人……\r\n你明白我的意思吗？呵呵，\r\n我也必须回报你才行呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eed85c5a3456f432bd41e4221095135b5ef0a1e201ce95ece95d547109a10c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d04cc8e190371431094f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよぉ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8100bf65bdbc23bcc53666fb5c3f218cc8104a0bee8f243b5f860b273dba6a2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c631e6f43e81ab1b89a1b9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc82d2742fb4fe638f6a1d839b73b8ecaf17ed3136eb7b341c239d5db6578af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2690f3f0d29bed9b2cd10df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你总是在替我设想最适合的道路……\r\n所以，我才能够不半途而废，\r\n维持奔跑的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66443cda35a4a468adbbbacb515889d5d5729be1c3c65ff9356442cd993685f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711398dbe907fa046706bb03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会想，为什么自己\r\n这么有幸能与你结缘呢……呵呵，\r\n虽然不可思议但很让人开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "322a944adc6fe3f8083ab61f91c249af832922d621b91b6c89ebbfb9050e2b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b7773aae829af4f185d2f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～\r\n我烤了很多年糕喔，\r\n我很喜欢在上面放萝卜泥呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddfd549adda28eabf095f53d8789e8054c85ad0d4edc624827fc20c8121cc28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66fdf2a8bdc1e7c6738d7c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说最近情人节的礼物\r\n变得越来越多元了。\r\n我要不要也来烤个苹果派呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed08a2715d0aefefb26576ba012cd62caf31f789c79346cbbdd61f8ae59876a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92db2bfae1fee2dac1fb0e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n我做了巧克力屋比派要给你。\r\n……要对大家保密喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f463b11ec4e1eb5dd804ff47afa2406859feea6a24689fba0ae51303ef04c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02dc3e840f69d77dbb116baf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "织女和牛郎一点一滴地努力了\r\n一整年才迎来七夕对吧～\r\n真了不起呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "272a9a9c72ab2b297b46b8e0642ef5648d2c3f0080fabc3995841ab433991831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719c110314dd967b12134ed9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了做万圣节的摆饰，\r\n有好多南瓜被挖空了。\r\n机会难得，就来做南瓜派吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b6fccd0558ec122afb3bf37de451a7b40e0d248887c03a2549bd52be8a35ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c54ac6be40d20d4d4200d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用拼接的方式做了\r\n拿来装饰宿舍的圣诞拼布。\r\n而且是非～常大一件喔，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07b7afecaba755656bfe49afe30053cfa7a060afce0cb668647e53619b623f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c791b7bced4f2c03083911c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我替训练员织了双袜子。\r\n里面还有礼物唷～\r\n至于礼物内容，你拆开就知道啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a6df3418562009ed24b3ed02c73c6b50bb4ae1267ed77bdfb31f15a8fa4962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43eda7dc55f0df1853d4b0f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "305a53fbe718d8c38e4366684e9028285f3b1433857d7a4458888ddc96524561",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc1713cdb357a6baeca523f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚点来做跨年荞麦面吧。\r\n大家大扫除完应该都累了，\r\n得让所有人好～好吃一顿才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f49a6b07a857054ea11232b621a0875d985c7ca0b9ad33a295b40fdc6104785d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ac8b50077de9f9cb243419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n你有什么想吃的东西吗？\r\n任何料理我都能做给你喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c97d029ddb57aa0bff20839a2eb13a575b181a650efc6c917c4bae5e177925ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94afdcbd171546a75f3536af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于你的生日礼物。\r\n我用那个……是叫皮革工艺吗？\r\n替你做了个名片夹。你喜欢吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92dba01eb11891b7e2e74923733746a6e97388486c3681ba8f75019296c79231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6ba553bde95048690950b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小历和小火山刚才送了我礼物唷～\r\n真奇怪，今天是什么日子啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e55a318dae48847b453307534f0c3190f8737a90a5cb8b352b0089623f0fa79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2162cc8dd0ab77ee80612269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要替我庆生……？\r\n那你可以陪我一起吃点心吗？\r\n我刚好烤了派呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3da2bf49e1ee46b926ac54396df6fb92b557f703b82935303540d4975cb8cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a54308d580170147a4fdfc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～好像有新公告。\r\n虽然数量多到令人目不暇给，\r\n但还是得一一看过才行唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "19151b9536eb7e47eb41539ce671c4336189e675ab8508678e452edbef69d2a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80cd004c11c601db4fe5a5b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。\r\n会不会是要送给你\r\n来慰劳平时的努力呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "21001832d3412d21e18b70c942ebf7560777476f30b28647df09198f822ed758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6afad9fbc8a18997c4fc1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像达成了呢～\r\n不愧是训练员！\r\n要记得领取奖励喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a58a2c54271c3e3b3fdc7d7f6350818e24790b2c89b4d52cb8666ae91c357a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aa1a5c20fb6e25d8b6dd02d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后好像要举办活动。\r\n大家看起来都好兴奋，\r\n让我也跟着开心起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "130306e839d9ae87acc64a28ea6b0c9f85cc34c16d431f931697e1428695adbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49561bcb1ceec51e96bd48d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，感觉好热闹呢～\r\n似乎正在举办活动……\r\n去请他们让我们一起加入吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce972249091837982685d8c46a72e91491d86347ed500b4b31324a248e1f5c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f03ba8a0f3d863dbdc74b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aec8cb8f02c92c4cd7ab5e7377406209eacb3c60f55e02734bed213a4e49046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8719e02865ac2e9fa52049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有个叫名册等级的东西\r\n提升了喔～真厉害呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cfe3db6f2f86d8e85056761d470fa0ee4acdbee9cb48404d895d404284401d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a001f20ffbdaa4100b150c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このカーディガンはあたしが\r\n手編みしたものでねぇ。ダイヤの\r\n編み目がポイントなのよぉ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6e69bf2887fc08efe4202ba995360ff20c726ff9c2ad812b438b2c05db0a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4b9abb07cfcc3f22757097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リッキーちゃんがねぇ、ネックレス\r\nを褒めてくれたのよぉ。なんだか\r\n“風水的にいい”らしいんだわぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1813a450bbe34ddadaecacc2e318d692389ee5a9edab6d0451d6d7be1acbd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1a63e39a6e84cd297b6a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビーズ編みぐるみをね、3つ揃いで\r\n作ったのよぉ。リッキーちゃんと\r\nタルマエちゃんにと思ってねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5722fbf1b4df14246bd5553c8d978de4cde311d1a72167893c4dd50e601719",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858db63b476015625776bbe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双方平手呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "476c2d6b192d823c8017cbdf1317a90a66912e32413250cf2c7d84568447ed35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c110812faa148cbce6dbdc1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都表现得很棒唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "840c084b8830112afab535502dfd9ddbd125ad2695219c9de35fcc9293d5fdf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4708abede3f955168803e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aec8cb8f02c92c4cd7ab5e7377406209eacb3c60f55e02734bed213a4e49046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f973982c715661856f74b04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双方平手呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "476c2d6b192d823c8017cbdf1317a90a66912e32413250cf2c7d84568447ed35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c394eddc77ff5233f42a10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～创下高分纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5151cb3eb3b1ee68fcffb5d36023691b6caf3f0eb39d62f967b477f6d8874af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d9bb326aea44e2e09b6e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持到最后一刻吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d84ffbc472a10c365833521efb90e60df82e01f27c39bc4327ced2069d9131a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd3f46aec3873ded7dceedf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c8762daf710493bd0b622a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练吗？\r\n我想要严苛一点的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66b170d3cc977e6e1f6539aa6e7561ef30800e91f750583099d4bb44150a24a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48ddbd17ae96c009f1638fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有许多温暖的回忆，\r\n真是令人开心呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "84fd597284c095cb4d37ef1631c9d661ede4fea9235e94027b9e29199fa45bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e129852568b94549abce4011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛吗？\r\n我随时都能跑唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e7fc207de35ce2e6d531649d245c3054fe346aed55060400d18bb6c7dfed01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f96ceeea00cf69be0625268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「小奇锐」",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a45835c8d993dcb98440f3a63ab28489ed612340efeb541c5549d87d52eb9a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a46c0677bd80c286f0d506cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2507216c7355066ed46117507dc5acc30e3f00f9a42ad81c2e9b9c0bf7b944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "1153"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
